agent-session-manager (1.1.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Notifications like herdr's: a sound when an unwatched agent finishes or
    needs your input, an in-app toast while you're in the window, and a
    desktop notification otherwise; a separate "Play a sound" switch.
  * Fix desktop notifications never being shown (unsupported PyGObject call).

 -- Máté Molnár <matemiller992@gmail.com>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 09:41:41 +0100

agent-session-manager (1.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Terminal workspace, inspired by herdr: spaces (project folders with
    their git branch), per-space tabs, and an agents list in the sidebar.
  * Agent states (working / blocked / done / idle) detected from Claude
    Code's terminal title and screen and from Cursor's prompts, rolled up to
    spaces; notifications when an unwatched agent finishes or needs input.
  * Split panes (shell panes next to the agent) and a Ctrl+B prefix with
    herdr's default keys; a go-to-agent picker.
  * Terminal-workspace look in Catppuccin by default with theme variants;
    the previous look stays as the Classic (Adwaita) style.
  * Foldable, switchable sidebar sections; a tab emoji picker.

 -- Máté Molnár <matemiller992@gmail.com>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:36:45 +0100

agent-session-manager (1.0.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Native streaming chat (Claude) with token-by-token output and interactive
    permission cards (Allow / Always allow / Deny) for every tool use.
  * Cursor chat in read-only ("ask") and trusted (auto-run) modes; resume any
    session into a chat tab.
  * Session replay: step through a transcript as native chat bubbles.
  * Interactive prompt cards over the terminal answer the agent's questions.
  * Advanced new-session options: model, permission mode, extra directories,
    and continue-last-session; open a session from a transcript file.
  * Folder path in the sidebar (toggle), permanent delete, and a quick tab
    emoji shortcut (Ctrl+Shift+E).
  * New generic agent icon and banner.

 -- Máté Molnár <matemiller992@gmail.com>  Sat, 21 Jun 2026 12:00:00 +0200

agent-session-manager (0.10.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Multi-agent support: a provider framework now manages Cursor sessions
    alongside Claude Code. The sidebar lists both, each row badged with its
    agent icon; the New Session menu offers one entry per installed agent;
    resume, close, and fork route through each session's own agent.

